$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_7F21_F64C';
<p>7f21_f64c</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #8d4a00;">Gene E</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #8d4a00;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8d4a00;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #2b6e32;">Gene K</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #2b6e32;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #2b6e32;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #12668b;">Gene Y</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #12668b;"><i>yucky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #12668b;">Gene Y</span> gives off an unpleasant odor and has a generally unappealing look.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, kidney, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5ce; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d3f4d8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #daedff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">204</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5ce; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d3f4d8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #12668b;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">597</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5ce; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #2b6e32;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #daedff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">177</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5ce; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #2b6e32;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #12668b;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">60</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8d4a00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d3f4d8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #daedff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">45</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8d4a00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d3f4d8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #12668b;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">180</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8d4a00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #2b6e32;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #daedff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">621</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8d4a00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #2b6e32;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #12668b;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">216</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,100</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkGreen;"><strong>double crossover genotype combinations</strong></span>. These allele combinations are a result of two genetic crossover events.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_7F21_F64C
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_1';
eky
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_2';
ek+
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_3';
e+y
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_4';
e++
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_5';
+ky
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_6';
+k+
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_7';
++y
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_7
$choice_8 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_8';
+++
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CHOICE_8
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CORRECT_1';
e++
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CORRECT_2';
+ky
LITERAL_7F21_F64C_CORRECT_2
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8);
@correct = ($correct_1, $correct_2);
$answer = CheckboxList([@choices], [@correct], labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
